<h1 id="sec-notebook-includes">Notebook includes</h1>
<p>The notebook owns its own note.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup></p>
<p>Before the included Markdown chain.</p>
<p>Part A keeps its own file-scoped note.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-2" href="#fn-2" role="doc-noteref">2</a></sup></p>
<h1 id="part-b">Part B</h1>
